BMPVIEW(1)

NAME
    bmpview - display a BMP image

SYNOPSIS
    bmpview file.bmp

DESCRIPTION
    Loads a BMP image from the filesystem and displays it on the framebuffer,
    scaling it down to fit when needed.  Press any key to close the image and
    return to the shell.

EXAMPLES
    bmpview /boot/splash.bmp

SEE ALSO
    bootsplash(1), diskview(1), mandel(1), plasma(1)
